# ==========================================
# Swift & Xcode Ignore Rules
# ==========================================
# Xcode local user settings and workspaces
**/xcuserdata/
**/.XCodePure/
**/DerivedData/

# Swift Package Manager build artifacts
**/.build/
**/.swiftpm/

# Package.resolved should be committed for apps, but can be ignored for libraries. 
# Uncomment if you are building a library:
**/Package.resolved

**/.xcodesamplecode.plist
**/.xcodeproj

# ==========================================
# OS & Editor Overhead
# ==========================================
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*~
\#*
.\#*
